# Component Rules

## Where things live
- `components/ui/` — presentation primitives, route-agnostic and reusable (ScoreGauge, charts, Metric, Section, SourceChip, InfoRow, Stat). No domain knowledge of MPs.
- `components/mp/` — MP-domain composites (MpCard, MpBrowser + MpFilterBar + MpGrid, detail header/info-box, `sections/*`).
- `components/layout/` — Header, Footer.
- Routes in `app/` compose these; pages hold no business logic.

## Rules
- Functional components, named exports, typed props (no implicit/explicit `any`).
- Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only for interactivity (MpBrowser/filters).
- Split any component over ~150 lines. One detail section per file under `components/mp/sections/`.
- Reuse neumorphic `@layer components` classes (`.neu-card`, `.neu-tile`, `.neu-pill`, `.neu-select`) instead of repeating raw `neu-raised`/`neu-inset` strings.
- Pull formatters from `@/lib/format`, source labels from `@/lib/sources`, data from `@/lib/data`. Never redefine `initials`, `pct`, cohort math, or the source registry locally.
- Keep `SlimMp` (list view) and `Mp` (detail view) distinct; pass the minimum a component needs.
